OL,3,ABrazil sees record fall in Amazon
OL,4,Adeforestation as key election looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazil's government says deforestation
OL,7,Frates in the country's Amazon and
OL,8,Fsavanna regions have fallen to record
OL,9,Flows ahead of a presidential election
OL,10,Frun-off in which the rainforest's
OL,11,Ffuture is a key issue.
OL,13,FLeft-wing President Luiz Inacio Lula da
OL,14,FSilva, when he assumed office three
OL,15,Fyears ago, pledged to end deforestation
OL,16,Fby 2030 in the Amazon. It had surged
OL,17,Funder his right-wing predecessor, Jair
OL,18,FBolsonaro.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
