OL,3,ABrazil sees record fall in Amazon
OL,4,Adeforestation as key election looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FLula will face Bolsonaro's son Flavio
OL,7,Fin the run-off on 25 October, with
OL,8,Fpolls suggesting a neck-and-neck race.
OL,9,FFlavio is expected to continue his
OL,10,Ffather's policies if he wins, though he
OL,11,Fhas pledged to fight organised crime in
OL,12,Fthe Amazon.
OL,14,FSatellite data shows that in the year
OL,15,Fto July 2026, the deforestation rate
OL,16,Ffell by 41.8% in the Amazon - the
OL,17,Fbiggest drop since records began in
OL,18,F1988. The fall in the Cerrado, Brazil's
OL,19,Fsavanna region, was 23.8%.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
